["er.request/1",{"definition_version":1,"fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"intent":{"causation":null,"command_id":"cmd-child-4b2986ac3c501abad38f28c55380038b30ba1dfbe49bc159ce6d935a98d5c829","command_type":"aep.entity.create/v1","correlation_id":"protocol-artifact-new","execution_id":null,"expected_revision":null,"payload":{"command":"create-entity","data":{"body":"## Scope\n\nAn aggregate view with no `group_by` and no parameter, such as #148's `DurationTotal`\n(`sum(duration)` over every `Order`), gets no scenario: synthesis refuses it with `ESS-SYNTH-016`\nbecause nothing ties its one row to the rows the scenario created\n(`crates/verify/ess-conformance/src/synthesize/aggregate.rs` ~651). This holds for every\nungrouped, unparameterised aggregate view, with or without `skip_absent`. Found by adversary pass 1\nof the aggregates unit (`review-result:adversary-retrofit-w2-aggregates-pass-1`).\n\n## Acceptance\n\nThe `DurationTotal` repro from #148 synthesizes a scenario whose expectation holds on a target\nthat starts empty and fails on a target that miscounts, or synthesis states in the suite why it\ncannot (for example: the scenario asserts the change in the total, not its absolute value).\n","status":"draft","title":"An ungrouped, unparameterised aggregate view gets a scenario"},"entity_type":"aep.story/v1","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/ungrouped-aggregate-views-are-witnessed"},"target":null,"task":null},"result":{"affected":["ent-1fffed48120f2f8c844c971e63302a55@1"],"audit":["aud-72754f2d2661390ac07dc90490347d19"],"command_id":"cmd-child-4b2986ac3c501abad38f28c55380038b30ba1dfbe49bc159ce6d935a98d5c829","consistency":"seq-000000000000","events":["evt-72754e2d26613757c07dc60490347800"],"outcome":"accepted"}},"lifecycle_state":"recorded"}},"kind":"create","recording":{"actor":"human:timo","causation":"cmd-child-4b2986ac3c501abad38f28c55380038b30ba1dfbe49bc159ce6d935a98d5c829","correlation":"protocol-artifact-new","record_id":"aep.applied:child-4b29